flowchart LR
  IMU[Six IMU channels] --> R[128-step resampling] --> S[Sensor CNN]
  RGB[Completed RGB clip] --> H[Optical-flow histogram] --> V[GRU]
  S --> F[Equal probability average or surviving branch]
  V --> F
  F --> O[D1 or D2 rejection]
  O --> C[Raw C2 set]
  C --> A[Accepted / uncertain / unknown]
  N[Neither input] --> M[Insufficient input]
